h seeded operational records\n- `models/wait_time_rf.joblib` — Trained Random Forest AI model artifact\n- `models/model_metrics.json` — Calculated validation metrics ($R^2 \\approx 0.996$, $\\text{MAE} \\approx 10\\text{ mins}$)\n- `dataset/synthetic_patients.csv` — 1,500 historical patient training records\n- `templates/index.html` — Full dashboard with all 14 working navigation sections\n- `static/css/` & `static/js/` — Styling and dynamic simulation & Chart.js scripts\n- `README.md` — Complete hackathon presentation guide & evaluation cheat-sheet","thinking":"The project files are now available on the user's computer. The files, both zipped and unzipped, are located in the specified directory. The user can access them through Windows File Explorer.\n\n\n"}
